    "updated_at": "2026-11-12T10:42:04Z",
    "body": "Refreshed with #1141 (1b230423, which carries main c6597a76 and #1131 ed6a1eb4) and #1136 (e905c004). Neither merge had a textual conflict. Two literal fixes were needed: `crates/ui/tests/sinker_setup.rs`'s electrode takes `turning: None` (main's new `Tool` field), and the `posted_gates` sinker judge states `pass: Single, cavity_x/y: 0` (#1136's `SinkerBurnOp` fields). PROCESS_VERSION is 28, the same as #1141. Head 793708f6.\n\nTests: ui `sinker_setup` 1/1, ui lib `sinker_machine` 6/6, app `solid_law_goldens` 5/5, `sinker_burn` 10/10. Clippy on app and ui with `-D warnings` is clean.\n\n**Still conflicting with main b7d3512e, so I stopped** (same hunk as #1141): #1116 moved `op_icon` into `op_icons.rs` and requires each `OpType` to have its own SVG-mastered `op-*` glyph. The stack's `SinkerBurn => Icon::Drill` breaks that law. The glyph belongs in #1131; once #1131 has it, this PR merges #1141 and then main.\n",
