    "body": "Refreshed with #1141 ab339b70 (59f100dc): merged the refreshed #1141 (which carries #1131 5fc71cf2). One conflict, crates/app/tests/sinker_burn.rs: took #1131's tests/edm/sinker_fixture.rs module in place of the in-file helpers; the fixture's burn() gains #543's SinkerBurnOp fields (pass Single, cavity_x/y 0) as the in-file helper had. One follow-up commit: #1131's lib fixture stock_sim_held_tests.rs names #543's new SinkerParams.stand as None (one spark gap stop, as the golden test does). #1136 still at 18dcf446 (already in); upstream/main already contained; PROCESS_VERSION stays 31. Tests: sinker_burn 10/10, sinker_burn_held 6/6, sinker_undersize 5/5, solid_law_goldens 5/5, app lib stock_sim_held 2/2, ui sinker_setup 1/1, ui lib sinker_machine 6/6, clippy -D warnings (app, ui, all targets) clean.",
